   219  ## 常见模式示例
   220  
   221  ### MatMul
   222  
   223  见上方语法概览。
   224  
   225  ### Elementwise — ReLU
   226  
   227  ```python
   228  sketch relu {
   229    symbols: N;
   230    tensors: X[N]: f32; Y[N]: f32;
   231  
   232    tile_size = 1024
   233  
   234    @llm_hint("parallel")
   235    for i in range(0, ceil(N, tile_size)):
   236      x_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=["fast", "input_cache"])
   237      y_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=["fast", "output_buffer"])
   238  
   239      load(X[i:i+tile_size] -> x_tile)
   240      relu(x_tile, y_tile)
   241      store(y_tile -> Y[i:i+tile_size])
   242  }
   243  ```
   244  
   245  ### Reduction — Softmax
   246  
   247  ```python
   248  sketch softmax {
   249    symbols: B, N;
   250    tensors: X[B, N]: f32; Y[B, N]: f32;
   251  
   252    @llm_hint("parallel")
   253    for b in range(B):
   254      x_row = alloc([N], llm_hint=["fast", "input_cache"])
   255      y_row = alloc([N], llm_hint=["fast", "output_buffer"])
   256      max_val = alloc([1], llm_hint=["fastest", "accumulator"])
   257      sum_val = alloc([1], llm_hint=["fastest", "accumulator"])
   258  
   259      load(X[b, 0:N] -> x_row)
   260  
   261      # 三阶段 softmax
   262      reduce_max(x_row, axis=0, max_val)
   263      sub(x_row, max_val, x_row)        # x = x - max
   264      exp(x_row, y_row)                 # y = exp(x)
   265      reduce_sum(y_row, axis=0, sum_val)
   266      div(y_row, sum_val, y_row)        # y = y / sum
   267  
   268      store(y_row -> Y[b, 0:N])
   269  }
   270  ```
   271  
   272  ### 复合算子 — GELU
   273  
   274  ```python
   275  sketch gelu {
   276    symbols: N;
   277    tensors: X[N]: f32; Y[N]: f32;
   278  
   279    tile_size = 512
   280  
   281    @llm_hint("parallel")
   282    for i in range(0, ceil(N, tile_size)):
   283      x_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=["fast", "input_cache"])
   284      y_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=["fast", "output_buffer"])
   285  
   286      load(X[i:i+tile_size] -> x_tile)
   287      gelu(x_tile, y_tile)
   288      store(y_tile -> Y[i:i+tile_size])
   289  }
   290  ```
